# Eluge cast with no Island under Bot1 is a 0/0 (CR 604.3) and goes to the graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5f)
# before its enters trigger resolves; the trigger is independent of its source (CR 113.7a) and still puts a flood counter
# on the Forest, which is then an Island. The effect lasts as long as the counter, so Eluge being gone does not matter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Eluge, the Shoreless Sea
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
