Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eluge, the Shoreless Sea.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Eluge, the Shoreless Sea; Black Lotus
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

